* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
# --- Atlas --- scripts and conf must stay LF everywhere: CRLF breaks the
# shebang in Linux containers and puts \r into sourced values, which fails
# the write guard open. Targeted rules only — repo-wide eol policy is yours.
*.sh text eol=lf
.atlas.conf text eol=lf
